### =============================================
### TRANS-SYNC - Pruebas completas via Gateway (:8080)
### =============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Login ADMIN (usuario seed: admin@trans-sync.com / admin123)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@trans-sync.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Login COUNTER (counter@trans-sync.com / counter123)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "counter@trans-sync.com",
  "password": "counter123"
}

### 3. Crear viaje (requiere token ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/viajes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "numeroViaje": "JUL-CUS-1024",
  "origen": "Juliaca",
  "destino": "Cusco",
  "fechaSalida": "2026-07-25T14:30:00",
  "precio": 45.00,
  "capacidad": 7
}

### 4. Listar viajes activos (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/viajes

### 5. Detalle de viaje (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/viajes/JUL-CUS-1024

### 6. Asientos disponibles (requiere token COUNTER/ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pasajes/viajes/JUL-CUS-1024/asientos-disponibles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Vender pasaje (requiere token COUNTER/ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pasajes/vender
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "numeroViaje": "JUL-CUS-1024",
  "asiento": 3,
  "documentoPasajero": "72000000",
  "nombrePasajero": "Juan Perez"
}

### 8. Buscar reserva (público - pantalla pasajero)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pasajes/buscar?documento=72000000&numeroViaje=JUL-CUS-1024

### 9. Historial del pasajero (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pasajes/historial?documento=72000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Intentar vender mismo asiento (debe fallar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pasajes/vender
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "numeroViaje": "JUL-CUS-1024",
  "asiento": 3,
  "documentoPasajero": "45121212",
  "nombrePasajero": "Carlos Mendoza"
}

### 11. Listar usuarios (solo ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Ver rutas del Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/gateway/routes

### 13. Health checks
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
###
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
###
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
